ed.\",\"y\":0.7150676112505181,\"x\":0.48949580051867037,\"width\":0.1512605037245639,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"At first, we wanted to\",\"y\":0.7150676109330574,\"x\":0.6428571483139777,\"width\":0.22058822276980383,\"height\":0.01458355141545753},{\"text\":\"have eight interschool debates, but we found\",\"y\":0.6989697360329848,\"x\":0.48949579581466857,\"width\":0.37184874068859014,\"height\":0.016146542560800947},{\"text\":\"difficulty in arranging suitable time, place\",\"y\":0.6823348533277296,\"x\":0.4892718522166818,\"width\":0.37444049214207853,\"height\":0.01873415389985178},{\"text\":\"and motions. We also succeeded in organis-\",\"y\":0.6699935608018879,\"x\":0.48949580752630617,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.014599462363003024},{\"text\":\"ing an interclass debating competition.\",\"y\":0.652503148129838,\"x\":0.48937303334850335,\"width\":0.374166742369186,\"height\":0.017781255173053623},{\"text\":\"Although the attendance of these interclass\",\"y\":0.6368014917166376,\"x\":0.4911928623430051,\"width\":0.3725420716751454,\"height\":0.021412880744614782},{\"text\":\"debates was not too promising, they helped\",\"y\":0.624919510392133,\"x\":0.48949580726370123,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.014615373310548518},{\"text\":\"the Society a great lot in choosing speakers\",\"y\":0.6090116281941208,\"x\":0.4894958065914324,\"width\":0.37394957076671514,\"height\":0.014620052639776393},{\"text\":\"for interschool debates. Furthermore, they\",\"y\":0.5943335479425759,\"x\":0.4894958081040372,\"width\":0.37394957076671514,\"height\":0.014810045074050149},{\"text\":\"provided every student with plenty of op-\",\"y\":0.5769511702203645,\"x\":0.48931828316510406,\"width\":0.3742754701126454,\"height\":0.016798494711124823},{\"text\":\"portunities to speak publicly. We also tried\",\"y\":0.5605568136313344,\"x\":0.4871788220253976,\"width\":0.3764866744640261,\"height\":0.018176316447359397},{\"text\":\"to organise another 