":0.07352941006482192,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.014615372696463291},{\"text\":\"educated women are better for marriage”\",\"y\":0.8808139540491405,\"x\":0.48949581295061423,\"width\":0.3697478822220203,\"height\":0.015988371407532842},{\"text\":\"while S.H.C.C. defended it. Chan Chi\",\"y\":0.8614844693560393,\"x\":0.48922195840072247,\"width\":0.37463251158248545,\"height\":0.019445723283697647},{\"text\":\"Keung, Yau Chi Hay, Simon Lam.\",\"y\":0.8473837214425515,\"x\":0.48949581162546396,\"width\":0.34033611918604656,\"height\":0.016106297873099695},{\"text\":\"and\",\"y\":0.8531873790976324,\"x\":0.8277310923240476,\"width\":0.03361344448355741,\"height\":0.011638202286503474},{\"text\":\"Lawrence Tsui were our representatives.\",\"y\":0.8326316781428209,\"x\":0.4913393509793361,\"width\":0.37225304891896804,\"height\":0.01809293166023651},{\"text\":\"The motion was defeated.\",\"y\":0.818313953569721,\"x\":0.48949580762269657,\"width\":0.22899158566497096,\"height\":0.013081395234588844},{\"text\":\"In general, we had a very successful\",\"y\":0.7886518994755763,\"x\":0.5311901596719942,\"width\":0.3326169887808865,\"height\":0.018814566514604114},{\"text\":\"and active year. We had a total of 18\",\"y\":0.7729066856083785,\"x\":0.489169015025715,\"width\":0.37462144008902615,\"height\":0.019042573279130837},{\"text\":\"debates, of which 6 were interschool de-\",\"y\":0.7564201286724521,\"x\":0.4892369153515229,\"width\":0.37448477811591574,\"height\":0.019908464116122904},{\"text\":\"bates. Two of these ended\",\"y\":0.743046654607914,\"x\":0.4890852231201144,\"width\":0.24025379269622094,\"height\":0.01814658428420579},{\"text\":\"in victories for\",\"y\":0.748546511493771,\"x\":0.726890753847692,\"width\":0.136554622206577,\"height\":0.0116279071481169},{\"text\":\"Wah Yan,two were losses while the other\",\"y\":0.727157907126929,\"x\":0.48932136236796414,\"width\":0.3743953261264535,\"height\":0.01840817045566734},{\"text\":\"two were mixed.\",\"y\":0.7150676112505181,\"x\":0.48949580051867037,\"width\":0.1512605037245639,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"At first, we wanted to\",\"y\":0.7150676109330574,\"x\":0.6428571483139777,\"width\":0.22058822276980383,\"height\":0.01458355141545753},{\"text\":\"have eight interschool debates, but we found\",\"y\":0.6989697360329848,\"x\":0.48949579581466857,\"width\":0.37184874068859014,\"height\":0.016146542560800947},{\"text\":\"difficulty in arranging suitable time, place\",\"y\":0.6823348533277296,\"x\":0.4892718522166818,\"width\":0.37444049214207853,\"height\":0.01873415389985178},{\"text\":\"and motions. We also succeeded in organis-\",\"y\":0.6699935608018879,\"x\":0.48949580752630617,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.014599462363003024},{\"text\":\"ing an interclass debating competition.\",\"y\":0.652503148129838,\"x\":0.48937303334850335,\"width\":0.374166742369186,\"height\":0.017781255173053623},{\"text\":\"Although the attendance of these interclass\",\"y\":0.6368014917166376,\"x\":0.4911928623430051,\"width\":0.3725420716751454,\"height\":0.021412880744614782},{\"text\":\"debates was not too promising, they helped\",\"y\":0.624919510392133,\"x\":0.48949580726370123,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.014615373310548518},{\"text\":\"the Society a great lot in choosing speakers\",\"y\":0.6090116281941208,\"x\":0.4894958065914324,\"width\":0.37394957076671514,\"height\":0.014620052639776393},{\"text\":\"for interschool debates. Furthermore, they\",\"y\":0.5943335479425759,\"x\":0.4894958081040372,\"width\":0.37394957076671514,\"height\":0.014810045074050149},{\"text\":\"provided every student with plenty of op-\",\"y\":0.5769511702203645,\"x\":0.48931828316510406,\"width\":0.3742754701126454,\"height\":0.016798494711124823},{\"text\":\"portunities to speak publicly. We also tried\",\"y\":0.5605568136313344,\"x\":0.4871788220253976,\"width\":0.3764866744640261,\"height\":0.018176316447359397},{\"text\":\"to organise another interclass debating com-\",\"y\":0.5479651165880162,\"x\":0.48949580752630617,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.014534883321060788},{\"text\":\"petition for the lower forms and an\",\"y\":0.5317756051155846,\"x\":0.4891244707341109,\"width\":0.374565060637718,\"height\":0.02017443485591608},{\"text\":\"individual debating competition; however，\",\"y\":0.5159513585566441,\"x\":0.4893009522328681,\"width\":0.37637351812318315,\"height\":0.01815709005381627},{\"text\":\"we failed because we did not have enough\",\"y\":0.5043604654978998,\"x\":0.49159664239204937,\"width\":0.3718487406885901,\"height\":0.014635027107391063},{\"text\":\"time.\",\"y\":0.4867997423042001,\"x\":0.4873949585796111,\"width\":0.04621848527775252,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"Finally, I would like to thank all the\",\"y\":0.4578235670654881,\"x\":0.5336134523590814,\"width\":0.329831912018532,\"height\":0.016097875080489432},{\"text\":\"Fathers for acting as our judges; especially\",\"y\":0.4433139539037918,\"x\":0.4894958065914324,\"width\":0.37394957076671514,\"height\":0.01611940060902317},{\"text\":\"Fr. Deignan and Fr. McGaley, who always\",\"y\":0.42877906982202774,\"x\":0.4915966357691504,\"width\":0.37184874068859014,\"height\":0.01455641007776498},{\"text\":\"gave us invaluable advice.\",\"y\":0.4142441862948959,\"x\":0.4915966479588309,\"width\":0.22899158566497096,\"height\":0.014603205826385413},{\"text\":\"we would also\",\"y\":0.41715116260811214,\"x\":0.7184873915877834,\"width\":0.14495798510174418,\"height\":0.011696229653441415},{\"text\":\"like to thank the students for their kind and\",\"y\":0.4011590471896721,\"x\":0.48949579911244084,\"width\":0.37394957076671514,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"generous support.\",\"y\":0.3837209301953214,\"x\":0.4915966465790476,\"width\":0.15336133380268896,\"height\":0.01164288161573146},{\"text\":\"Paul Chan.\",\"y\":0.3574826972381716,\"x\":0.7247714751186369,\"width\":0.09877637996230004,\"height\":0.